# Claude
.claude/*
# but the visibility marker is load-bearing: it tells
# claude-md-init whether internal-only conventions may be
# written into CLAUDE.md. Absent, it defaults to internal,
# which is the wrong answer for a public repo.
!.claude/visibility

# Planning is tracked, active and archive both. The PWF convention requires
# each commit to carry its own checkbox flip in planning/active/task_plan.md,
# so `git log -- planning/` tells the full story; an ignored active/ makes that
# impossible and does not survive a move between machines.
docs
inst/doc
/doc/
/Meta/
Rplots.pdf
